   "@type": "aif:I-node",
   "aif:claimText": "The staffing gap did not contribute to the slip."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/ca1",
   "@type": "aif:CA-node",
   "aif:Conclusion": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/ra"
   },
   "aif:Premise": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/o1"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/ca2",
   "@type": "aif:CA-node",
   "aif:Conclusion": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/ra"
   },
   "aif:Premise": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/o2"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/o1",
   "@type": "aif:I-node",
   "aif:claimText": "Delays often have several causes; the vendor delay and the staffing gap could both have contributed."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/o2",
   "@type": "aif:I-node",
   "aif:claimText": "Confirming one cause says nothing about the other unless the two are known to be mutually exclusive."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/p1",
   "@type": "aif:I-node",
   "aif:claimText": "The release slipped because of the vendor delay or because of the staffing gap."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/p2",
   "@type": "aif:I-node",
   "aif:claimText": "The release slipped because of the vendor delay."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/ra",
   "@type": "aif:RA-node",
   "aif:Conclusion": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/c"
   },
   "aif:Premise": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/affirming-a-disjunct/map/p1"
